graph TD
    V[Voluntary Exchange]:::process --> A
    V --> B
    A[Agent A]:::agent -->|Offers Goods| G[Goods]:::resource
    B[Agent B]:::agent -->|Offers Services| S[Services]:::resource
    G -->|Traded for| S
    S -->|Traded for| G
    A <--> B
    A -->|Gains| UA[Higher Utility A]:::outcome
    B -->|Gains| UB[Higher Utility B]:::outcome
    UA -->|Result| WIN[Win‑Win Outcome]:::outcome
    UB -->|Result| WIN
    classDef agent fill:#ffccff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef resource fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef outcome fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef process fill:#ffe5cc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;